NAOMI — black blazer and corset, rimless glasses, lip piercing, dark hair. Drumming powerfully and passionately on a dark worn vintage kit (large bass drum, toms, snare, cymbals on stands), body rocking to the beat, hair flying from the hits and the wind. No logos, text or branding anywhere on the drums or cymbals — clean surfaces.
